# Vercel build context hygiene (harness-scaffolded; project-owned — edit freely).
#
# A git worktree links `prisma/generated` and `node_modules` as symlinks into the
# main checkout (scripts/worktree-setup.js). The Vercel remote build does not
# follow those the way a local run does, so they must never be uploaded. Without
# this, a worktree deploy can fail with
#   ENOTDIR mkdir '/vercel/path0/prisma/generated'
# and the alias silently stays on the previous deployment.
node_modules/
.prisma/
prisma/generated/
.agents/
.harness-backup/
.serve/
.next/cache/
*.log
